      dealing: 'Players simultaneously deal one face-up card each to begin rows, extending rows until matches occur.',
    },
    turnFlow: "Players simultaneously extend rows from their decks. Any time equal ranks appear anywhere in layout, a player may cover matching cards with new cards from own deck. Cascades continue while matches exist. When no matches remain, both extend rows again. A player with empty deck wins by tapping a valid match and calling 'Aggravation!'.",
